{
  "folder": "08 - Credentials on File (CoF)",
  "description": "## Credentials on File (CoF) / Subscriptions\nTokenize a card or ABA account, then charge it later without re-entering credentials.\n\n**Typical flow:** `1. Link Account` (or `2. Link Card`) -> wait for callback -> `3. Get Token Details` (auto-saves `{{pwt}}`/`{{ctid}}`) -> `4. Payment` -> `6. Remove` at the end.\n\n`callback_url` must be base64-encoded in the hash/body - the scripts do that automatically for https URLs. Run `7. Subscription` to test recurring CITR_FIX payments.",
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Link Account (ABA Account)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          },
          "raw": "{\n  \"request_id\":     \"{{request_id}}\",\n  \"request_time\":   \"{{request_time}}\",\n  \"merchant_id\":    \"{{merchant_id}}\",\n  \"ctid\":           \"{{ctid}}\",\n  \"return_deeplink\": \"{{cof_return_deeplink_b64}}\",\n  \"token_flag\":     \"{{token_flag}}\",\n  \"currency\":       \"{{currency}}\",\n  \"callback_url\":   \"{{cof_callback_b64}}\",\n  \"hash\":           \"{{computed_hash}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/payment-credential/v3/aof/link-account",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "payment-credential",
            "v3",
            "aof",
            "link-account"
          ]
        },
        "description": "## ⚡ Quick test\n1. Just hit **Send** — it generates `{{request_id}}` and returns a deeplink + QR (Visualize tab) to approve in the ABA Mobile app.\n2. After approving, run **3. Get Token Details** (code 09 until the link is completed) or watch for the callback.\n\nHash: merchant_id + request_time + ctid + return_deeplink + callback_url + request_id + token_flag + **frequency** + **purchase_amount** + currency (last two often empty strings).\n\nBody must use the **same** return_deeplink/callback_url strings as in the hash (plain https -> base64). Set {{cof_return_deeplink}} / {{cof_callback_url}} as plain https (auto-encoded).\n\npwt arrives at callback; use Get Token Details with the logged {{request_id}}."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Restore the shared PayWay helper library (Postman runs every script in its own scope):",
              "var __h = pm.collectionVariables.get('__helpers');",
              "if (!__h) throw new Error('The `__helpers` collection variable is missing - re-import the full collection JSON (it holds the shared helper library source).');",
              "eval(__h);",
              "// Link Account - hash: merchant_id+request_time+ctid+return_deeplink+callback_url+request_id+token_flag+frequency+purchase_amount+currency",
              "var C = pm.collectionVariables;",
              "var reqTime = utcNow();",
              "var requestId = genRequestId('REQ');",
              "var rdB64 = ensureB64(C.get('cof_return_deeplink'));",
              "var cbB64 = ensureB64(C.get('cof_callback_url'));",
              "var msg = C.get('merchant_id') + reqTime + C.get('ctid') + rdB64 + cbB64 + requestId + (C.get('token_flag')||'CITI_FLEX') + '' + '' + (C.get('currency')||'USD');",
              "C.set('request_id', requestId);",
              "C.set('request_time', reqTime);",
              "C.set('cof_return_deeplink_b64', rdB64);",
              "C.set('cof_callback_b64', cbB64);",
              "C.set('computed_hash', hmac512(msg, C.get('secret_key')));",
              "console.log('b4hash:', msg);",
              "console.log('request_id:', requestId, '- use it with Get Token Details after the callback fires.')"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Restore the shared PayWay helper library (Postman runs every script in its own scope):",
              "var __h = pm.collectionVariables.get('__helpers');",
              "if (!__h) throw new Error('The `__helpers` collection variable is missing - re-import the full collection JSON (it holds the shared helper library source).');",
              "eval(__h);",
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "try {",
              "  var j = pm.response.json();",
              "  if (j.status) {",
              "    pm.test('status.code present', function () { pm.expect(j.status.code).to.not.be.empty; });",
              "    console.log('status.code:', j.status.code, '-', j.status.message || '');",
              "    if (String(j.status.code) === '00') {",
              "      console.log('Link approved. request_id =', pm.collectionVariables.get('request_id'), '(watch the callback for pwt)');",
              "    } else {",
              "      console.log('Non-success code. See error-code table in description. request_id =', pm.collectionVariables.get('request_id'));",
              "    }",
              "  }",
              "} catch (e) { console.log('Response is not JSON; likely a redirect page.'); }",
              "var vj = {}; try { vj = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) {}",
              "if (vj.data && (vj.data.qr_string || vj.data.qrString)) visualizeQr('', vj.data.qr_string || vj.data.qrString, 'Link Account - scan in ABA Mobile, approve, then run Get Token Details with request_id ' + pm.collectionVariables.get('request_id'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
