        "description": "## ⚡ Quick test\n1. ABA **account** tokens only — needs `{{pwt}}`; extends validity by 90 days from today.\n\nABA Account tokens only. Extends validity by 90 days.\n\nHash formula: ctid + request_time + pwt + merchant_id + request_id"
