        "description": "## ⚡ Quick test\n1. Just hit **Send** — creates a recurring `CITR_FIX` subscription and returns the first-payment QR (Visualize tab); pay it to activate the token via callback.\n2. Tune with `{{sub_frequency}}` (1W/1M/2M), `{{sub_lifetime}}`, `{{sub_payment_option}}`.\n\nCITR_FIX subscription - uses the **v1 payments/purchase** hash (PayWay demo order):\nreq_time+merchant_id+tran_id+amount+**items_b64**+''+shipping+**ctid**+''+firstname+lastname+email+phone+**type**+**payment_option**+return_url_b64+cancel_url_b64+continue_success_url_b64+return_deeplink_b64+currency+**custom_fields**+return_params+payout+lifetime+skip_success+token_flag+frequency\n\nFrequency: 1W | 1M | 2M. Set {{sub_lifetime}}, {{sub_payment_option}}, {{items_b64}} etc.\nResponse opens a hosted page to approve the subscription."
